### TITLE ###
[F2] CRLF and bare CR normalized to LF
### INPUT [raw] ###
"x = 1\r\ny = 2\r\n"
### FORMATTED [raw] ###
"x = 1\ny = 2\n"

### TITLE ###
[F3] Exactly one trailing newline at end of file
### INPUT [raw] ###
"x = 1"
### FORMATTED [raw] ###
"x = 1\n"

### TITLE ###
[F3] Multiple trailing newlines collapse to one
### INPUT [raw] ###
"x = 1\n\n\n"
### FORMATTED [raw] ###
"x = 1\n"

### TITLE ###
[F4] Trailing whitespace stripped from every line
### INPUT [raw] ###
"x = 1   \ny = 2\t\n"
### FORMATTED [raw] ###
"x = 1\ny = 2\n"
